   ("Check it against Google's rules first", "Google only removes reviews that break its policies. A review from someone who was never a customer, a competitor, a review swap, a rant about something unrelated to your business, insults, threats, someone's phone number or address, or an ad all qualify. A harsh but honest opinion does not."),
